      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来她指的是之前那场九号球比赛吧。\n天狼星象征挑衅似地露出自信的笑容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "345e6209fc2bbf9150755dcb23c712ca82e47ceaf87bbe7b00dcf3da129404b4",
