      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我成为天狼星象征的训练员已经有一段时间了，\n我们还是一样为了“选择”而持续比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2932a41cd163ddeb92593f146cc8a5c7e361a9ea310dc8e20a981f9b99f0eae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
